# How to run your first E2B sandbox - ComputeSDK
created: 2025-12-19, last updated: 2026-06-21, [Read more](https://www.computesdk.com/blog/how-to-run-your-first-e2b-sandbox/)

Click the button on the main page.
Then go to your E2B dashboard.
In your sandboxes -> list, you should see a new sandbox created!
